'DiophantineConsistency.IPRANativeBoundedGuard.orderGuard' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
'DiophantineConsistency.IPRANativeBoundedGuard.allOrderGuard' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
