    ∀⁰ ∼LO.FirstOrder.Semiformulaᵢ.rel LO.FirstOrder.Language.ORing.Rel.lt ![a, b] ⋎ q 🡘
      ∀⁰ (LO.FirstOrder.Semiformulaᵢ.rel LO.FirstOrder.Language.ORing.Rel.lt ![a, b] 🡒 q)
